OL,3,GNEWSA'I once felt alone - now I'm there
OL,4,Afor others'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has described how she now works
OL,7,Fat a charity that once was a lifeline
OL,8,Ffor her in a tough period.
OL,10,FAs a child and then teenager, Jess
OL,11,FBrooks cared for her father who is
OL,12,Fparalysed from the chest down, cooking,
OL,13,Fcleaning and shopping for him.
OL,15,F"Growing up I felt very alone," she
OL,16,Ftold BBC South East.
OL,18,F"I was also bullied a lot. People found
OL,19,Fout my dad was disabled and then
OL,20,Ftargeted me because of it."
